error: `with` makes a new value of a struct from another, and this is a `Label*`
  the struct a `T*` points at stays with its owner; `with` takes a copy of it
  --> error_with_pointer.sg:9:18
 9 |     var bigger = label with { size = 20 }
   |                  ^^^^^
  hint: make `Label` `Clonable` (`Label : Clonable`), then `label.clone() with { ... }`
